pve-ups-panel (2.1.6) stable; urgency=medium

  * Config.pm: preserve NOTIFYCMD/NOTIFYFLAG lines when wizard rewrites
    upsmon.conf. Add _extract_notify_lines() to read existing notification
    settings before overwriting and append them back, preventing the
    wizard from silently dropping notification configuration.
  * Config.pm: write comment-only ups.conf in netclient path to clear
    any stale standalone device entries left from a previous mode.
  * pve-ups-panel.js: replace connection test Ext.Msg.alert() dialogs
    with inline status display. Show spinner while request is in flight,
    green check on success, red X with error message on failure.

